    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR ON BUSINESS MANAGEMENT (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目的培養學生多元思考模式，提供學生了解各管理研究領域，找出自己未來論文發展方向，以及未來解決問題的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is to introduce related issues and practical cases of management topics, as well as integrated planning issues, management decision analysis, advanced information applications and future development. The content of the course is designed with academic research and practical case analysis. The purpose is to cultivate the students’ abilities and to analyze the high-level and practical topics of related management research.",
